Rāma arms sword and triple-bent bow --- Deer lures Rāma vanishing and reappearing --- Rāma grows angry yet deluded follows --- Weary deer rests shaded among wild herds --- Rāma looses blazing Brahmā arrow into Mārīca heart --- Dying Mārīca sheds deer form and mimics Rāma cry --- Rāma takes venison and rushes toward Janasthāna